# Oblatenjagd 8x8 bitmap font (see docs/art-style.md section 11).
# Frame i is the i-th character of this string (90 chars):
#    !"'(),-./0123456789:;?ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzÄÖÜäöüß„“–…×%+é
# Rows: 0 = capital umlaut dots, 1 = lowercase umlaut / i / j dots and
# ascender top, 1-6 = cap height (baseline row 6), 3-6 = x-height,
# 7 = descenders. Glyphs start at column 0; the engine advances by the
# rightmost opaque column + 2. Only `w`: the renderer tints the glyph
# and draws the `k` shadow itself.
sprite = font
size   = 8x8
anim   = glyphs frames=90 ticks=1
---
